    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.where-does-the-solar-system-end-the-oort-cloud.087c53b887954a95853b4a28fdf73284",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 10,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "The Voyager 1 spacecraft took 35 years to leave the Sun\u0027s magnetic influence. It\u0027s traveling 1 million miles each day.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "T\u00E0u v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 Voyager 1 \u0111\u00E3 m\u1EA5t 35 n\u0103m \u0111\u1EC3 r\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi v\u00F9ng \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u1EEB tr\u01B0\u1EDDng c\u1EE7a M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi. N\u00F3 di chuy\u1EC3n 1 tri\u1EC7u d\u1EB7m m\u1ED7i ng\u00E0y.",
        "StartTime": 67.9,
        "EndTime": 76
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.where-does-the-solar-system-end-the-oort-cloud"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.where-does-the-solar-system-end-the-oort-cloud.09fff27797404150b0d122f152d1651a",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 9,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "It\u0027s made of icy pieces of space debris the sizes of mountains and sometimes larger. This is where some comets come from.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "N\u00F3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o n\u00EAn t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng m\u1EA3nh b\u0103ng c\u1EE7a r\u00E1c v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 c\u00F3 k\u00EDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc b\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng ng\u1ECDn n\u00FAi v\u00E0 \u0111\u00F4i khi c\u00F2n l\u1EDBn h\u01A1n. \u0110\u00E2y l\u00E0 n\u01A1i m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 sao ch\u1ED5i \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB.",
        "StartTime": 57,
        "EndTime": 67.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.where-does-the-solar-system-end-the-oort-cloud"
      }
    },
